<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title><%= title %></title>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.8/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet" integrity="sha384-sRIl4kxILFvY47J16cr9ZwB07vP4J8+LH7qKQnuqkuIAvNWLzeN8tE5YBujZqJLB" crossorigin="anonymous">
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.8/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js" integrity="sha384-FKyoEForCGlyvwx9Hj09JcYn3nv7wiPVlz7YYwJrWVcXK/BmnVDxM+D2scQbITxI" crossorigin="anonymous"></script>
    <style>
        body { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0b1220 0%, #111827 55%, #0f172a 100%); color: #e5e7eb; }
        .navbar-brand { font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .08em; }
        .hero-card { background: rgba(17, 24, 39, 0.75); border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.2); }
        .stat-card { background: rgba(31, 41, 55, 0.8); border: 1px solid rgba(148,163,184,0.15); }
        .feature-card { background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1px solid rgba(148,163,184,0.15); }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <nav class="navbar navbar-expand-lg navbar-dark bg-dark border-bottom border-secondary-subtle">
        <div class="container py-3">
            <a class="navbar-brand" href="/">FinTrack</a>
            <div class="ms-auto d-flex gap-2">
                <a class="btn btn-outline-light" href="/login">Entrar</a>
                <a class="btn btn-success" href="/register">Criar conta</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <main class="container py-5">
        <section class="row align-items-center g-4">
            <div class="col-lg-7">
                <p class="text-success fw-semibold mb-3">Financeiro pessoal inteligente</p>
                <h1 class="display-4 fw-bold mb-3">Controla as tuas finanças com clareza.</h1>
                <p class="lead text-secondary mb-4">
                    Organiza receitas, despesas, contas e objetivos num único lugar para tomares decisões financeiras melhores.
                </p>
                <div class="d-flex gap-3 flex-wrap">
                    <a class="btn btn-success btn-lg" href="/register">Começar agora</a>
                    <a class="btn btn-outline-light btn-lg" href="/login">Já tenho conta</a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-lg-5">
                <div class="hero-card rounded-4 shadow p-4">
                    <div class="stat-card rounded-3 p-3 mb-3">
                        <small class="text-secondary text-uppercase">Saldo total</small>
                        <div class="fs-2 fw-bold mt-2">€ 8.450,00</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="stat-card rounded-3 p-3 mb-3">
                        <small class="text-secondary text-uppercase">Receitas</small>
                        <div class="fs-3 fw-bold text-success mt-2">€ 3.200,00</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="stat-card rounded-3 p-3">
                        <small class="text-secondary text-uppercase">Despesas</small>
                        <div class="fs-3 fw-bold text-danger mt-2">€ 1.980,00</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="row g-4 mt-4">
            <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="feature-card rounded-4 p-4 h-100">
                    <h3 class="h4 mb-3">Contas em painel</h3>
                    <p class="text-secondary mb-0">Segue todas as tuas contas e saldos em tempo real com uma vista organizada.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="feature-card rounded-4 p-4 h-100">
                    <h3 class="h4 mb-3">Orçamentos</h3>
                    <p class="text-secondary mb-0">Define limites por categoria e acompanha rapidamente o que estás a gastar.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="feature-card rounded-4 p-4 h-100">
                    <h3 class="h4 mb-3">Objetivos</h3>
                    <p class="text-secondary mb-0">Cria metas de poupança e vê o teu progresso ao longo do tempo.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>
</body>
</html>
